  "keyFeatures": [
    "60-minute single-pass long-form speech recognition (VibeVoice-ASR-7B)",
    "Real-time streaming TTS with ~200ms first-audio latency (VibeVoice-Realtime-0.5B)",
    "Multi-speaker long-form TTS supporting up to 4 speakers and 90-minute audio (VibeVoice-TTS-1.5B)",
    "Multilingual support for 50+ languages in ASR",
    "Structured rich transcription: speaker diarization, timestamps, and content (Who, When, What)",
    "Customized hotwords for domain-specific ASR accuracy",
    "LoRA fine-tuning support for ASR models",
    "vLLM plugin for high-performance API serving with OpenAI-compatible endpoints",
    "Next-token diffusion framework with continuous speech tokenizers at 7.5 Hz",
    "Transformers-native integration via Hugging Face"
  ],
